<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SOCCER-FOUR NATIONS CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FOUR NATIONS CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN, South Africa 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four Nations Cup results on Saturday:</p>
<p>Australia 2 Ghana 0 (halftime 1-0) Scorers: Damian Mori (44), Paul Trimboli (69)</p>
<p>South Africa 1 Kenya 0 (1-0) Scorer: Dumisa Ngobe (21)</p>
</text>
